## 1.92.264
- fix crash on invalid handle during shutdown
- add lum_sdk_init_ui api to run sdk ui (dialog) mode only (no sdk core running)
- add lum_sdk_init_monitor api to run sdk in monitor (service) mode only (not showing ui, wait for selection status changes and run/stop sdk core)
- add ui/monitor modes
- add cs_ui_monitor_modes application sample

## 1.91.791
- add lum_sdk_init_autorun to allow starting dialog code without running sdk (showing dialog)
- add lum_sdk_run to run sdk (show dialog)
- add lum_sdk_run_wait to run sdk and wait for user selection
- upgrade sdk to .NET 4.5 (remove dependency on buggy BCL libs)
- fix support WPF applications
- add WPF application sample

## 1.84.644
- rename util.dll to lum_sdk_util.dll to avoid conflict with partner naming

