## 1.63.247
- First (wide) release version
- lum_sdk(32|64).dll is now a native non-managed dll (/MT)
- msvcr120.dll required to run managed part of sdk is now embedded in dll
- dialog size can now be controled using lum_sdk_set_dlg_size api
